## App Architecture

[3–5 sentences describing the app design. Examples:]

```
Flutter 3.x mobile app (iOS + Android) consuming the orders/users/notifications REST API.
State managed via Riverpod (AsyncNotifier for server state, StateNotifier for UI state).
Navigation via go_router. Auth tokens stored in flutter_secure_storage; HTTP via dio with
an auth interceptor. Optimistic updates on favorite/cart actions with explicit rollback on failure.
```

[Or for BLoC:]

```
Flutter 3.x app using flutter_bloc. Each feature owns a Bloc with sealed-class events and states.
Navigation via go_router; deep-linking handled by the same router config.
HTTP via dio + retrofit-generated clients. Repositories sit between blocs and data sources.
```

