## Run / Test / Build

```bash
# Install
flutter pub get

# Generate code (freezed, json_serializable, retrofit, etc.)
dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs

# Run (debug)
flutter run                          # default device
flutter run --flavor dev             # flavored builds
flutter run -d chrome                # web

# Test
flutter test                         # unit + widget tests
flutter test --reporter compact      # compact CI output
flutter test integration_test/       # integration tests (requires device/emulator)

# Lint / format
dart format --set-exit-if-changed .
dart analyze --fatal-infos

# Build (release)
flutter build apk --release          # Android APK
flutter build appbundle --release    # Android AAB (Play Store)
flutter build ios --release          # iOS (requires macOS + Xcode)
flutter build web --release          # Web
```

## Known Gotchas

[App-specific quirks. Examples:]
- **`mounted` after `await`**: in any `State`, check `mounted` before `setState` or using `context`
- **`BuildContext` across async gaps**: triggers `use_build_context_synchronously` — fix, don't suppress
- **Generated files**: never hand-edit `*.g.dart` or `*.freezed.dart`; re-run build_runner
- **iOS-only Pod issues**: `cd ios && pod install --repo-update` after dependency bumps
- **Optimistic update without rollback**: see `flutter-patterns.md §Isolated Real-Persistence Tests (P3 / P4)`. Compensating action required on API failure
- **Native edits (`ios/`, `android/`)**: see `flutter-patterns.md §Native Platform Folders`. Permission added to Dart without matching `<uses-permission>` / `NS*UsageDescription`, or `MethodChannel` name mismatch between Dart and native — silent at compile time, fails at runtime
- **AGP / Kotlin / Gradle bumps**: must move together; partial bumps are the most common CI build break
